mcpu-cpp (MCPU languages preprocessor)

mcpu-cpp is a source preprocessor for the MCPU toolchain.
It provides C-style macros, conditional compilation, file inclusion,
line control, and related preprocessing facilities.

External text is UTF-8 while internal text processing uses UCS-2.
It supports relocatable MCPU installations and configurable system
include trees, including per-user configuration and --sys-root.

It uses LibMPU and LibMPUIO; ZUBR is required only to regenerate
the expression parser from its grammar sources.

Requires:
  libmpu   >= 1.0.28
  libmpuio >= 1.0.8
  zubr     >= 4.1.2
